          "shall": "The agent shall read 30 top stories and put at most 5 in the digest when no setting is given, and shall refuse a stories-to-read setting outside 10 to 100 or a digest-size setting outside 1 to 10 by saying the allowed range, reading nothing.",
          "kind": "default",
